so we know he is down with the program, 3 he's a nice guy anda good coder. well I guess that would be 4 too. That'd be my nomination forour immortal member, I don't know if he would do it because he IS the rulessheriff for the place but we can give it a shot. If y'all have any other nominations, this isn't a dictatorship, we can vote on who we want to ask.Guarantee I will veto any request for Exos though >:) That's news fromyour fearless leader. Lemme know what y'all think.Relgar, a.k.a. Beez (beez@wizvax.net)**relgar**To: baerSubj: your questionCc: tuppence flannel icehouse boadicea kryten roxanne figleaf cartel (if he's still alive) peraphon tetsuharaDate: Jun 24Dear Baer,Sorry I haven't returned your correspondence lately, I've been verybusy with extranneous engangements. I have given some thought to the questionyou put to me at our last discussion. Through much research and inquiryof some of the worlds top scientists it has become clear to me that theanswer to your question is in the negative. I'm sorry...Asper Cream is not a ratio.Best Regards,Relgar**relgar**To: peraphonSubj: May ::NETHED:: increaseCc: tuppence kryten izekiel tetsuhara manfred tas quazar relgarDate: Jul 28Greetings all,Please welcome our newest member to the clan. Today being the 28th day of July in the year MCMXCVII, Quazar was given the initiationrights by myself, leader and founder of ::NETHED:: Please treat him withthe respect that any ::NETHED:: member deserves.Relgar a.k.a. BeezBy the by... if there's anything you guys feel you need to do to welcome him to the clan >:) please feel free.**peraphon**To: relgarSubj: Ye Official ::NETHED:: updateCc: tuppence kryten figleaf izekiel tetsuhara manfred tas quazarDate: Aug  2Ye Official ::NETHED:: Member Roster------------------------------------Current membership:---------------------Relgar - Our founder and beloved High Commander.Peraphon - Second banana and all-round nice guy.Tu